      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --bg: #1a1c2c;\n    --card: #2a2d3e;\n    --text: #f0f0f0;\n    --accent: #ff6b6b;\n    --accent-hover: #ff8e8e;\n    --border: #5a5d7e;\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body {\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: var(--text);\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  .calculator {\n    background: var(--card);\n    border: 4px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 0;\n    padding: 24px;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 400px;\n    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  label {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: var(--text);\n  }\n  input, select, button {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    border: 2px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 0;\n    outline: none;\n    transition: border-color 0.1s, background 0.1s;\n  }\n  input:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent);\n  }\n  input:hover, select:hover {\n    border-color: var(--accent-hover);\n  }\n  button {\n    background: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--bg);\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border: 2px solid var(--accent);\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  button:hover {\n    background: var(--accent-hover);\n    border-color: var(--accent-hover);\n  }\n  button:active {\n    transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n    box-shadow: none;\n  }\n  .result-label {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: var(--text);\n  }\n  #result {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: right;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    border: 2px solid var(--border);\n    color: var(--accent);\n    min-height: 60px;\n    word-break: break-all;\n  }\n  [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n  @media (max-width: 400px) {\n    .calculator { padding: 16px; }\n    h1 { font-size: 18px; }\n    input, select, button { font-size: 16px; padding: 8px 10px; }\n    #result { font-size: 22px; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"calculator\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <label for=\"left\">Left Number</label>\n    <input type=\"number\" id=\"left\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5\" step=\"any\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <label for=\"right\">Right Number</label>\n    <input type=\"number\" id=\"right\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3\" step=\"any\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n    <select id=\"operation\">\n      <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n      <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n      <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n      <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n    </select>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <span class=\"result-label\">Result</span>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"left right operation\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      const left = document.getElementById('left');\n      const right = document.getElementById('right');\n      const op = document.getElementById('operation');\n      const btn = document.getElementById('calculate');\n      const result = document.getElementById('result');\n\n      function compute() {\n        const a = parseFloat(left.value);\n        const b = parseFloat(right.value);\n        if (left.value.trim() === '' || right.value.trim() === '' || !isFinite(a) || !isFinite(b)) {\n          result.textContent = 'Error';\n          return;\n        }\n        let r;\n        switch (op.value) {\n          case 'add': r = a + b; break;\n          case 'subtract': r = a - b; break;\n          case 'multiply': r = a * b; break;\n          case 'divide':\n            if (b === 0) { result.textContent = 'Error'; return; }\n            r = a / b;\n            break;\n          default: result.textContent = 'Error'; return;\n        }\n        result.textContent = Number.isFinite(r) ? String(r) : 'Error';\n      }\n\n      btn.addEventListener('click', compute);\n      [left, right, op].forEach(function (el) {\n        el.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n          if (e.key === 'Enter') { e.preventDefault(); compute(); }\n        });\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nAn offline, pixel-style calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No packages, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two number inputs (`left` and `right`), supporting negative values.\n- Operation selector with add, subtract, multiply, and divide.\n- Calculate button (ID `calculate`).\n- Result output (ID `result`) initially shows `0`.\n- Input validation: empty fields, non-finite numbers, and division by zero display exactly `Error`.\n- Output shows only the numeric result or `Error` — no extra labels inside the output.\n- Keyboard accessible: all controls are labeled and focusable; pressing Enter in an input triggers calculation.\n- Responsive layout works from 360px wide.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in the Left field.\n3. Enter a number in the Right field.\n4. Choose an operation from the dropdown.\n5. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter) to see the result.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Empty or non-numeric input → `Error`\n- Non-finite values (e.g., `Infinity`, `NaN`) → `Error`\n- Division by zero → `Error`\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — complete app (HTML, CSS, JS inline, under 200 lines)\n- `README.md` — this file\n\n## Constraints Met\n\n- Offline only, no external assets or imports.\n- Uses `addEventListener`, no inline event handlers.\n- Uses relative paths and required extensions.\n- Includes `[hidden] { display: none !important; }` CSS rule.\n- Cohesive 5-color palette, system fonts ≥16px, visible hover/focus/pressed states.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
